# ============================================================
# Markdown Files (Except README.md)
# ============================================================
# Ignore all .md files in root and subdirectories
*.md
**/*.md

# But keep README.md files at any level
!README.md
!readme.md
!Readme.md

# Keep VIPER identity document (used by greeting skill + general chat at runtime)
!VIPER-IDENTITY.md

# Keep documentation in src/ directory
src/**/*.md

